            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>Wireless IntraOral x-ray imaging Sensor (WIOS) (1) holder that secures in place the WIOS (1) from a hump (105) on the backside of the WIOS (1) corresponding to a battery (30). The holder with the WIOS (1) attached can be painlessly and comfortably positioned inside the dental arch, since there are no brackets holding the WIOS (1) from its edges, but instead from the battery hump (105). Additionally, the WIOS (1) can be secured on the holder in reverse (rotated by 180 degrees) thus adding flexibility and versatility during intraoral x-ray imaging.</p>
            </abstract>
